# r009-r025 capability contracts and modules
SPLIT R:EXTRA-M1-0004 | a: Placement belongs to the architecture frame and technique to the leaf capability. | b: Implementation-independent policy (framework-independent testing and frontend rules) stays outside the modules. | c: Test-project placement and the frontend workspace location belong to the frame; the persistence leaf binds to frame roles and does not decide placement.
