SPLIT R:EXTRA-M1-0005 | a: Replacing a leaf replaces its facets (planning, rule facet, knowledge content, adapter data) without touching the framework-independent rules. | b: Clearing the optional frontend removes its facets and planning import with nothing else to change. | c: A persistence provider change edits only the declared provider-variant sections, the provider property and the declared string-comparison property. | d: A frame replacement supplies every role mapping and facet and reviews embedded rules that use the frame's layer names.
