# r026-r035 hooks
SPLIT R:RULE-M1-0011 | a: NuGet and npm dependency additions and updates go through the add-dependency workflow first (need and approval check, package choice, latest stable compatible version, deprecation, vulnerability and license checks). | b: Dependency commands are denied until the identical command is re-run with the trailing comment '# add-dependency: checked' (self-certified marker; restore-only installs not gated). | c: Edited dependency entries trigger a reminder to confirm the add-dependency workflow was applied.
SD P:RULE-M1-0080 R:RULE-M1-0011#c | S: edits of dependency entries M: advisory post-tool reminder in both (F7) E: none in either T: after the edit
RD COMPOUND_PART R:RULE-M1-0013 P:RULE-M1-0082 | R bundles consistency with CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md and the implementation, recording via architecture-decision and the Stop-reminder lifecycle; P: the post-edit consistency message.
