RD DETAIL_DIFFERENCE R:RULE-M1-0014 P:RULE-M1-0083 | same custom-settings reminder; R adds the Stop-reminder repetition lifecycle from stop.js, which P's record does not cite.
SD P:EXTRA-M1-0039 R:EXTRA-M1-0009 | S: edits of instruction files M: blocking post-tool feedback (P ENFORCED; R MUST PostToolUse feedback) E: none in either T: after the edit
CX X:BF-M1-0040 | Manifest or project-file changes caused by branch switches or other revision changes are exempt from the workflow reminder.
RD COMPOUND_PART P:RULE-M1-0084 X:BF-M1-0040 | P reports the reminder for unexplained manifest/project changes with this revision-change exception; X states the exception.
RD OVERLAP R:EXTRA-M1-0008 P:RULE-M1-0084 | R: project files changed without a recognized command are reported for confirmation (with the Reserved reference-graph rule); P: the hook's routing message.
CX X:BF-M1-0041 | Post-tool checks block on WARN-level findings as well as errors after successful tool calls, while after failed calls findings are only added as context.
SD P:EXTRA-M1-0037 X:BF-M1-0041 | S: post-tool checks M: blocking (P ENFORCED), X no modality E: after failed shell commands findings are context only (both) T: after the tool call
