RD EXAMPLE_GENERAL P:EXTRA-M1-0040 X:BF-M1-0042 | P: the guard fails closed on any internal error or malformed input; X: the missing tool_name case.
RD COMPOUND_PART P:RULE-M1-0086 R:RULE-M1-0015 | P's Stop reminder covers seed-data OR migration companions; R RULE-M1-0015 is the seed part (plus repetition lifecycle).
RD COMPOUND_PART P:RULE-M1-0086 R:EXTRA-M1-0010 | R EXTRA-M1-0010 is the migration part (plus lifecycle); labels differ (P ORACLE_LINKED, R EXTRA).
