RD DETAIL_DIFFERENCE R:RULE-M1-0016 P:RULE-M1-0087 | same missing-test reminder; R adds the repetition lifecycle not cited by P's record.
RD OVERLAP R:RULE-M1-0014 P:RULE-M1-0088 | P: Stop reminders for changed CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md/SPECIFICATION.md; R: the custom-settings reminder.
RD OVERLAP R:RULE-M1-0013 P:RULE-M1-0088 | R: the specification consistency reminder.
